<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Bhutto to ask court to restore her.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Bhutto to ask court to restore her.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's ousted prime minister Benazir Bhutto said on Monday she will lodge a legal appeal with the Supreme Court in the next two days asking that she be restored to power.</p>
<p>Bhutto told Reuters Television in an interview that she considered her sacking last week by President Farooq Leghari to be &quot;a constitutional coup, a presidential coup and an act against democracy&quot;.</p>
</text>
